  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Container resource monitoring",
      "items": [
        "Kubelet exposes cAdvisor on each eligible node, including core. No application sidecars.",
        "Prometheus scrapes /metrics/cadvisor every 5s through the authenticated Kubernetes API node proxy.",
        "Reports use raw scrape timestamps, a 30s CPU rate window, memory working sets and independent coverage checks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Control ownership",
      "items": [
        "Native HPA owns replica counts. The Go scheduler/descheduler owns proposed placement and eviction.",
        "CPU baseline uses Metrics Server; latency HPA uses UE response time through Prometheus Adapter. cAdvisor is the experiment resource source.",
        "Mobility with fixed replicas clamps HPA min=max=9; eviction may briefly reduce ready replicas."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Scope and lifecycle",
      "items": [
        "Logical overview: the 5G radio, UPF and transport path is collapsed into the UE-to-Service connection. NodePort may route to another node.",
        "Campaign lifecycle sampling uses --pods-only, independent of Metrics Server. Reports join pod inventory with historical Prometheus measurements.",
        "This is repository configuration, not evidence that the live scrape targets are healthy."
      ]
    }
  ]
